1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,339
BriefCheck: turn a scattered brief
into an acceptance checklist.

2
00:00:05,339 --> 00:00:10,000
Local rules. English and Chinese.
No runtime AI service.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:17,163
Trace source facts
and keep missing details unresolved.

4
00:00:17,163 --> 00:00:23,000
Optional work stays outside
the agreed scope.

5
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:32,796
Edit the acceptance criteria
before confirming a deliverable.

6
00:00:32,796 --> 00:00:39,000
Suggestions are not client agreements.

7
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:45,400
Record clarification separately
from the original source.

8
00:00:45,400 --> 00:00:51,000
The unanswered-question
count updates as you work.

9
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:58,395
Revise the source and regenerate:
compare changed facts.

10
00:00:58,395 --> 00:01:07,000
Matching edits remain; confirmation
resets after a source change.

11
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:20,302
Keep separate local projects
and switch between them.

12
00:01:20,302 --> 00:01:29,000
Up to 20 projects in this browser.

13
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:36,885
Export and import
a portable JSON project.

14
00:01:36,885 --> 00:01:44,000
Source facts are rechecked on import.

15
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:51,632
Export a standalone client preview
with no external assets.

16
00:01:51,632 --> 00:01:59,000
Review the source, scope
and confirmation state together.

17
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:03,376
The workspace also adapts
to a narrow mobile viewport.

18
00:02:03,376 --> 00:02:08,000
No signatures, payments
or legal guarantees are provided.

